# Groundwork's night. The server's clock is UTC. "gw STEP" runs
# that Groundwork command with --day set to yesterday's date.
# m  h  dom mon dow  command
5    2  *   *   *    gw ingest --only tradeline
20   2  *   *   *    gw ingest --only frontline
35   2  *   *   *    gw comments
40   2  *   *   *    gw ingest --only suppliers
45   2  *   *   *    gw ingest --only catalogue
50   2  *   *   *    gw ingest --only ledger
55   2  *   *   *    gw ingest --only reference
15   3  *   *   *    gw ingest --only relay
30   3  *   *   *    gw contracts
45   3  *   *   *    gw dbt build
30   4  *   *   *    gw publish
